<concept id="GUID-51E5C29A-6B7E-487A-8832-5D709410C16A" xml:lang="en-US">
  <title cid="R1o2L" id="GUID-467BECC9-358B-4943-8B2F-876A776B3FAF">Example</title>
  <conbody cid="13dEYq">
    <section cid="examples">
      <title>Examples of Accessing the API</title>
      <p cid="postauth">
        See <xref format="html" href="authenticate.html" scope="local">Authenticate</xref> page to acquire a token.
      </p>
      <sectiondiv outputclass="tabbed-interface"> 
        <sectiondiv outputclass="tab-pane" otherprops="tab-title(curl)">
          <p>The following example shows how to use curl to List customers.</p>
          <codeblock cid="curl-request" outputclass="bash">curl -X GET \
    -H "Authorization: &lt;auth-token&gt;" \
    "https://${API_SERVER_URL}/api/v1/customers"</codeblock>
        </sectiondiv> 
        <sectiondiv outputclass="tab-pane" otherprops="tab-title(Python)">
          <p>The following example shows how to use Python to List customers.</p>
          <codeblock cid="python-request" outputclass="python">import requests
headers = { "Authorization": "&lt;auth-token&gt;" }
url  = "https://" + SERVER_URL + "/api/v1/customers"
resp = requests.get(url, headers=headers)</codeblock>
        </sectiondiv> 
      </sectiondiv> 
    </section>
    <section cid="response">
      <title>Example of the Response Body</title>
      <p cid="resp-body-text">The following example shows the contents of the response body.</p>
